\f1\i0 \cf2 They thought the one person\'97the one with the investigative instincts, broadcasting infrastructure and cheekbones necessary to expose them small part in his mother\'92s schemes\'97was eating pork knuckle in Liechtenstein.\
\'93You idiots,\'94 Alexander said to himself in a the back of a van full of surveillance gear. \'93You don\'92t even know I\'92m back.\'94 \
Alexander stared at the shredded business cards beneath him. He planted his boot on a torn VorpalTech logo and ground into the floor.\
His foot slid; he windmilled back and cracked his head on his one trophy\'97awarded for services to criminal entertainment in television\'97which he never left for a mobile broadcast without, and had planted on a rack of gear when he got into the back of the van.\
Whether for better or worse, Alexander was never quite the same again.
